696f6e23232344415441232323">After firing all weapons can illuninate the unit it shot at and it's self during night fighting</characteristic><characteristic name="Pg" typeId="mh6-506723232344415441232323">87</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4b9cab0a-81a9-6718-6216-ab7cc116aca6-6ed3225" name="Smoke Launchers" hidden="false" typeId="mh6-57617267656172204974656d23232344415441232323" typeName="Wargear Item" page="87"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="mh6-4465736372697074696f6e23232344415441232323">Once per game, instead of shooting or moving flat out, may gain a 5+ cover save</characteristic><characteristic name="Pg" typeId="mh6-506723232344415441232323">87</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="baabbf00-7335-e09d-6835-1c2a5bf29f6b-6ed3225" name="Deathwing Vehicle" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade" page="40"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="6f18-a8fc-2c5b-9517" value="30" /></costs><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="baabbf00-7335-e09d-6835-1c2a5bf29f6b-maxSelections-6ed3225" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><rules><rule id="08ee33de-020f-32bb-f5f3-9a0d81ff2b54-6ed3225" name="Preferred Enemy (Chaos Space Marines)" hidden="false" page="40"><description>Reroll all failed to hit and to wound rolls of 1 against the chosen enemy in both shooting and assault.</description></rule><rule id="0eda8555-d81f-14c8-fb0d-785934e25efb-6ed3225" name="Deathwing Vehicle" hidden="false" page="0"><description>Preferred Enemy (Chaos Space Marines), you may make your opponent re-roll any vehicle damage result</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry></selectionEntries><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="7fab85c4-4ccc-cde0-4590-edb1a727896d-6ed3225" name="Vehicle Options" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><selectionEntries><selection