        <rule name="Weaken Resolve" id="adce-4968-a5e9-247b" hidden="false">
          <description>Attempt to use this power when an enemy unit with a model within 12" has to take a Morale check. On a successful Psychic test then the enemy unit must take its Morale check on a 3D6 added together. This power may only be used once per player turn.</description>
