    <selectionEntry id="84ad-cbaf-7ba2-cdd2-bf89a" name="Ravenwing Silence Squadron" hidden="false" collective="false" type="unit">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="df97-d968-4aaa-46f6-bf89a" name="Capture Run" page="144" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>When making a Bombing Run with the stasis bomb of this Formation's Ravenwing Dark Talon, do not roll for scatter; the stasis bomb hits automatically. Furthermore, enemy models that suffer an unsaved Wound from the stasis bomb must roll two dice and pick the highest result when taking their Initiative tests to see if they are removed as 
casualties. In missions that use Victory Points to determine the winner, the Slay the Warlord Secondary Objective is worth D3 additional Victory Points to the controlling player at the end of the game if the enemy Warlord was removed as a casualty as a result of a Capture Run.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="e77d-2f50-a6f0-4c20-bf89a" name="Fighter Escort" page="144" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Make a single roll for this entire Formation during reserve rolls. You can re-roll. On a successful Reserve Roll, all of the units in this Formation arrive from Reserve. </description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries />
